Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.13,0:24:58.10,0wrt,FX,0,0,0,,{\fn方正字跡-童體硬筆字體\fs40\1cFFE6BB\3cD2935C\b1\frz-5\bord1.8\pos(765,24)}大
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.13,0:24:58.10,0wrt,FX,0,0,0,,{\fn方正字跡-童體硬筆字體\fs40\1cFFE6BB\3cD2935C\b1\bord1.8\pos(797,21)}人
